  "qualification_limits": [
    "The vendor AES example has no known ciphertext, only an encrypt/decrypt round-trip. No standard byte-array API is offered.",
    "Both vendor uint16 timeout loops post-decrement through zero and can wrap; HAL uses bounded Rust ranges instead.",
    "TRNG chapter contains no analog-ready, startup timing, entropy-strength or health/error status contract.",
    "Pure linear-feedback input is deterministic and not accepted by HAL.",
    "Register clearing on idle Drop covers volatile writes to documented key/data registers, not internal copies, caller RAM or certified erasure.",
    "Busy timeout/drop retains gates; no reset/abort is attempted."
  ],
